# The enneagonal antiprism

The polyhedron `Antiprism.EnneagonalAntiprism.polyhedron`: the convex hull of 18 points,
with coordinates in `ℚ(θ)` (`polyEval c θ` is `∑ cᵢ θⁱ`).
-/

namespace Nieuwland.Antiprism.EnneagonalAntiprism

/-- `θ`: the largest root of
`1/9 - 8 * x ^ 2 + 26 * x ^ 4 - 14 * x ^ 6 + 5 * x ^ 8 - 6 * x ^ 10 + x ^ 12`
in the interval `(3/2, 3)` (`realRoot`, `Definitions/Polynomials.lean`). -/
noncomputable def theta : ℝ :=
  realRoot [1/9, 0, -8, 0, 26, 0, -14, 0, 5, 0, -6, 0, 1] (3/2) 3

@[inherit_doc] local notation "θ" => theta

